{"4627310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KONBOYS", "steam_appid": 4627310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/c7f0e2c61c56287854912538de24035e.avif?t=1786386501\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras_big/c7f0e2c61c56287854912538de24035e.webp?t=1786386501 width=1560 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Mycel™ </strong>we take your personal well-being seriously. Thanks to our revolutionary <strong>Compound M,</strong> death has become a simple pause in productivity instead of being an absolute. As a biological unit of personnel<strong> </strong>(or &quot;Employee&quot;), you enjoy the privilege of experiencing the benefits of <strong>Compound M.</strong> Should any mishap occur, your consciousness will be transferred to your new body, sent immediately through our <strong>Personnel Supplies Tube</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/b42bdbabd88d8b1606cfef146a5b2abb.poster.avif?t=1786386501\" width=1170 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/b42bdbabd88d8b1606cfef146a5b2abb.webm?t=1786386501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/b42bdbabd88d8b1606cfef146a5b2abb.mp4?t=1786386501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most recent analyses indicate that our broadcasting network is at historic lows in capacity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locale: </strong>Use your signal detector to find damaged stations in a procedurally generated open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair: </strong>Each station may exhibit different types of malfunctions. Identify them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand: </strong>Each repaired antenna extends our network, maintaining the stability of <strong>Compound M</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean: </strong>Any non-functional element on our property obstructs visual harmony. Please, use our special delivery vehicle and our <strong>Mycel™ Shredding System to</strong> transport and recycle all materials that meet these characteristics, whether organic or inorganic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/8b5bdf6beb245c2d4534ba6ce476e65a.poster.avif?t=1786386501\" width=1170 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/8b5bdf6beb245c2d4534ba6ce476e65a.webm?t=1786386501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/8b5bdf6beb245c2d4534ba6ce476e65a.mp4?t=1786386501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the credits earned to purchase improvement protocols through the base's pneumatic delivery system:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tissue Optimization: </strong>Increase your physical stamina to protect your life expectancy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardware Improvements: </strong>Buy tools that make browsing healthier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brute Force: </strong>Because a strong employee carries more scrap metal in less time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/c86ea45664cbd4f61af456ae35953c6f.poster.avif?t=1786386501\" width=1170 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/c86ea45664cbd4f61af456ae35953c6f.webm?t=1786386501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/c86ea45664cbd4f61af456ae35953c6f.mp4?t=1786386501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been proven that cooperation increases the chances of success in an extreme situation. Team synergy is mandatory; personal survival is optional. If a teammate falters, <strong>Mycel™ </strong>offers two ways to manage resources:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Replacement: </strong>Request your new body by paying the full biomass fee.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Eco-Citizen&quot; Recycling Plan: </strong>Retrieve the corpse of your former partner and use the <strong>Mycel™ Shredding System. </strong>You will receive a <strong>90% discounting</strong> the cost of regeneration. We condemn the waste of resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras/e789e34ea1af2108170fe36cd0ed8c64.avif?t=1786386501\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627310/extras_big/e789e34ea1af2108170fe36cd0ed8c64.webp?t=1786386501 width=1560 height=269 /